{
  "_description": "AI speech-tell corpus. `patterns`/`soft_patterns` drive score_script's regex scan; `hard_banned` drives the post-cold-open scrub gate; `ledger` tunes the self-discovering phrase-frequency ledger; `rhythm` is the measurable half of the voice spec. See CLAUDE.md > Voice and AI Tells. `soft_patterns` are reported but excluded from total_hits, which gates Opus escalation — a new family goes here unless the extra escalation is intended and costed.",
